; A link line after the first posting is reported and ignored, and the
; transaction kept, so the balance assertion after it passes.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-01 open Assets:B

2020-01-02 * "link after a posting"
  Assets:A   1 USD
  ^link
  Assets:B  -1 USD

2020-01-03 balance Assets:A 1 USD
